                  <lb/>ZEALOT.</p>
               <lg>
                  <l>Papal Barbarity.</l>
                  <l/>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify">Zealot poem and motto</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="italic">A</hi>
                  <lb/>ZEALOT.</p>
               <lg>
                  <l>Religion is a pure and Spotless Dame;</l>
                  <l>But Zeal, misguided, is a furious Flame.</l>
               </lg>
               <p rend="justify">Application.</p>
               <p rend="justify">Bigotry is the Parent of Enthusiasm.</p>
